WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 26=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(The Fall of Cui Xiongkai and Wang Chen)

00:48.559 --> 00:51.160
Who was sent to
secretly protect Wei Hao?

00:51.170 --> 00:52.880
Two teams of Iron Guards
were dispatched.

00:54.560 --> 00:55.240
Good.

00:58.839 --> 01:00.239
You could also choose to kill me.

01:03.879 --> 01:06.760
But I have already
prepared several copies of those things.

01:07.679 --> 01:08.960
If anything happens to me,

01:09.160 --> 01:10.760
those things will immediately appear

01:10.760 --> 01:11.920
on His Majesty's desk.

01:12.730 --> 01:14.920
At that time, His Majesty
will know exactly what to do.

01:19.119 --> 01:20.560
Your influence is far too great.

01:20.960 --> 01:22.079
Every time trouble arises,

01:22.719 --> 01:25.399
the great clans have
people in court to back you up.

01:25.400 --> 01:26.880
They impeach me whenever they please.

01:27.560 --> 01:29.399
I need to have my own influence as well.

01:31.119 --> 01:32.759
(Since I cannot bring out)

01:32.759 --> 01:34.359
(printing technology openly,)

01:34.640 --> 01:36.520
(I will nurture talent
for this world instead.)

01:36.960 --> 01:37.759
(Perhaps)

01:37.880 --> 01:40.159
(future generations
will think of movable type.)

01:41.010 --> 01:42.880
(By then, it will have
nothing to do with me.)

01:44.840 --> 01:46.520
About this first condition,

01:46.640 --> 01:48.719
ten thousand guan per year

01:48.719 --> 01:50.599
is too much.

01:50.799 --> 01:51.359
Look,

01:51.599 --> 01:53.879
we are seven different clans here.

01:54.359 --> 01:57.640
That would be
70,000 guan a year for you.

01:57.640 --> 01:58.439
Can't you just...

01:58.439 --> 02:00.840
I've realized you all
are terrible at arithmetic.

02:00.879 --> 02:02.519
With my movable type,

02:02.640 --> 02:05.280
if I don't earn
10,000 guan a month, I lose.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.680
That's 120,000 guan a year.

02:07.680 --> 02:09.280
And that is the bare minimum.

02:09.439 --> 02:10.319
We could

02:10.319 --> 02:11.959
earn 300,000 guan a year.

02:12.519 --> 02:15.120
The people of the Great Yong,
including your great clans,

02:15.380 --> 02:17.000
who wouldn't want to collect more books?

02:17.580 --> 02:19.439
Besides, are the great clans
really that poor?

02:19.719 --> 02:20.480
Ten thousand guan.

02:20.480 --> 02:21.239
It's pocket change.

02:21.359 --> 02:22.480
It's hardly any money at all.

02:23.599 --> 02:23.959
This...

02:23.959 --> 02:24.959
You brat.

02:25.560 --> 02:29.120
Our clan only makes
20,000 guan a year in revenue,

02:29.239 --> 02:31.280
and you want to take half of it?

02:31.280 --> 02:31.799
Why...

02:31.799 --> 02:33.290
Why don't you just be the clan leader?

02:33.439 --> 02:34.239
I won't do it.

02:34.599 --> 02:35.560
You can't just become

02:35.560 --> 02:37.120
a clan leader whenever you want.

02:39.319 --> 02:42.000
Training 500 people is too many.

02:42.000 --> 02:43.319
And every year, too?

02:43.480 --> 02:44.280
How about this?

02:44.640 --> 02:46.400
One hundred people every year.

02:46.400 --> 02:47.159
Is that okay?

02:47.200 --> 02:48.239
One hundred people?

02:48.319 --> 02:49.560
Don't even think about it.

02:49.570 --> 02:50.760
If I only have a hundred a year,

02:50.760 --> 02:52.890
how many of them can
actually enter the court as officials?

02:53.100 --> 02:54.599
They wouldn't even
have a chance to serve

02:54.599 --> 02:55.639
before being bullied
to death by you lot.

02:55.639 --> 02:57.719
You have those things in your hands,

02:58.080 --> 03:00.520
so who will dare bully you now?

03:00.520 --> 03:01.120
Exactly.

03:01.120 --> 03:02.719
Who knows what will happen later?

03:02.719 --> 03:03.759
Wei Hao,

03:04.120 --> 03:05.039
rest assured.

03:05.159 --> 03:07.560
From now on, we from the great clans

03:07.599 --> 03:09.120
will avoid you whenever we see you.

03:10.120 --> 03:10.919
Yes, yes.

03:11.000 --> 03:11.400
Exactly.

03:12.319 --> 03:13.120
But

03:13.360 --> 03:15.280
five hundred people are just too many.

03:15.919 --> 03:16.599
What about

03:17.599 --> 03:18.400
two hundred?

03:18.479 --> 03:19.280
No way.

03:21.280 --> 03:22.439
Three hundred people?

03:22.680 --> 03:23.879
That's the final number.

03:23.879 --> 03:24.599
Three hundred?

03:28.560 --> 03:29.719
Three hundred people,

03:30.900 --> 03:32.599
and each clan will make
a one-time payment

03:32.599 --> 03:33.639
of 10,000 guan.

03:36.080 --> 03:36.759
Then,

03:37.360 --> 03:39.360
can you sell the glazeware to us?

03:40.000 --> 03:41.880
If you make
a one-time payment of 20,000 guan,

03:42.199 --> 03:43.599
I will let you sell it

03:43.780 --> 03:44.879
in your clans' territories.

03:46.080 --> 03:47.360
The glazeware...

03:47.800 --> 03:48.520
Then...

03:48.520 --> 03:49.039
Father.

03:49.520 --> 03:50.080
Father.

03:52.039 --> 03:52.840
It's a deal.

03:53.719 --> 03:54.719
It's a deal, right?

03:56.520 --> 03:57.319
Yes.

03:57.319 --> 03:58.000
Good.

03:58.599 --> 04:00.120
Twenty thousand it is.

04:01.319 --> 04:02.520
On the 22nd,

04:02.639 --> 04:05.719
deliver it to my engagement banquet.

04:08.840 --> 04:09.639
It's just

04:10.280 --> 04:11.879
that this deadline is a bit too tight.

04:12.080 --> 04:12.639
We...

04:12.719 --> 04:14.639
We don't have that much ready cash.

04:14.800 --> 04:16.360
That's your own problem.

04:16.680 --> 04:17.960
Figure it out yourselves.

04:18.090 --> 04:20.000
You can't expect me
to keep backing down, right?

04:21.039 --> 04:21.840
Fine.

04:22.319 --> 04:23.439
We'll find a way.

04:23.680 --> 04:24.680
Does that mean

04:24.840 --> 04:25.639
the deal is done?

04:27.840 --> 04:28.639
Let's eat.

04:45.759 --> 04:47.080
Give it a try.

04:48.960 --> 04:51.199
I told you that we'd talk after eating.

04:51.199 --> 04:51.919
But you didn't listen.

04:51.919 --> 04:52.879
See? You've lost your appetite.

04:52.879 --> 04:54.360
(Wei Hao)

04:54.360 --> 04:55.439
(is a talent,)

04:55.719 --> 04:56.800
(so we must win him over.)

04:57.280 --> 04:58.319
Wei Hao,

04:58.879 --> 05:01.040
you are a son
of the great clans, after all.

05:01.240 --> 05:04.000
Don't lean too much
toward His Majesty's side.

05:04.000 --> 05:06.480
Keep us in your heart as well.

05:06.600 --> 05:07.399
Indeed.

05:09.160 --> 05:09.959
I'm done eating.

05:12.360 --> 05:13.160
I

05:13.839 --> 05:15.319
don't care about your nonsense,

05:16.120 --> 05:17.439
so don't worry about mine either.

05:18.000 --> 05:19.959
Let's not interfere with each other.

05:20.800 --> 05:22.240
If you provoke me again,

05:22.240 --> 05:23.480
don't say I didn't warn you.

05:23.639 --> 05:24.199
We won't.

05:24.199 --> 05:24.839
I

05:25.079 --> 05:26.120
am not a patient man.

05:28.200 --> 05:30.120
Just remember to come
to the engagement banquet.

05:31.560 --> 05:32.360
Don't forget.

05:33.240 --> 05:33.839
I'm off.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.439
Don't let it go to waste.

05:41.079 --> 05:41.879
Finish it up!

05:47.937 --> 05:49.687
(Ganlu Palace)

05:50.040 --> 05:51.160
Your Majesty,

05:51.199 --> 05:52.639
we couldn't find out anything.

05:53.000 --> 05:55.560
We saw Wei Hao go in with a chest

05:55.560 --> 05:57.120
and come out with the same chest.

05:57.480 --> 05:59.399
He looked very relaxed.

05:59.920 --> 06:01.160
Couldn't hear a thing?

06:03.079 --> 06:05.879
That brat even cleared out all
the surrounding private rooms?

06:07.160 --> 06:08.439
That brat

06:08.480 --> 06:10.240
is definitely hiding something from me.

06:11.920 --> 06:14.800
Could it be that he really has
a trump card in his hand?

06:16.560 --> 06:17.879
I have an idea.

06:18.600 --> 06:20.120
From among our great clans,

06:20.120 --> 06:22.240
we should choose
a woman to give to Wei Hao.

06:22.439 --> 06:23.600
I wonder if that would work.

06:23.920 --> 06:25.519
You mean...

06:25.879 --> 06:27.279
To win Wei Hao over, of course.

06:27.279 --> 06:29.839
We can't let him side
entirely with His Majesty.

06:29.839 --> 06:31.800
He must lean toward our side.

06:33.879 --> 06:34.680
Gentlemen,

06:34.920 --> 06:37.040
don't even think about it.

06:37.879 --> 06:39.920
Wei Hao is currently obsessed

06:39.920 --> 06:42.240
and completely infatuated
with the Eldest Princess.

06:42.240 --> 06:44.199
If you try to win him
over by sending women,

06:44.399 --> 06:45.199
it

06:45.360 --> 06:47.240
won't just fail,

06:47.639 --> 06:49.079
but it'll also ruin everything.

06:49.759 --> 06:50.560
Right now,

06:50.759 --> 06:53.000
the most important thing
is to keep him steady.

06:53.079 --> 06:55.879
Don't let him reveal
whatever is inside that chest.

06:55.879 --> 06:57.120
Don't worry

06:57.360 --> 06:58.720
about anything else.

06:58.879 --> 07:00.120
It's not necessary.

07:02.120 --> 07:03.360
What a blunder.

07:04.160 --> 07:05.720
It's all because of these fools.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.959
Knowing Wei Hao had such abilities,

07:09.240 --> 07:10.879
you still went and provoked him.

07:11.319 --> 07:13.360
Who could have known the fool

07:14.560 --> 07:16.000
was capable of this?

07:16.319 --> 07:17.560
Indeed. How could a human

07:17.800 --> 07:19.680
even invent those things?

07:20.639 --> 07:22.560
You ignorant fools.

07:22.639 --> 07:25.399
With what capability
did you dare provoke Wei Hao?

07:26.079 --> 07:26.639
Father...

07:29.720 --> 07:30.519
Clan Leader,

07:31.279 --> 07:33.040
I didn't realize

07:33.560 --> 07:35.639
it would lead to such a disaster.

07:35.639 --> 07:36.800
A mistake is a mistake.

07:36.800 --> 07:38.519
Stop looking for excuses!

07:38.519 --> 07:40.280
In the centuries
of the great clans' history,

07:40.290 --> 07:42.360
when have we ever been so humiliated?

07:42.560 --> 07:45.600
Wei Hao is a man of immense talent.

07:45.600 --> 07:48.439
The great clans should have
approached him actively.

07:48.439 --> 07:49.560
But look at you lot,

07:49.560 --> 07:51.439
you've blocked our path.

07:53.639 --> 07:54.959
If we don't punish you severely,

07:55.639 --> 07:58.199
how can we show
our sincerity to Wei Hao?

07:58.240 --> 08:01.519
Without severe punishment,
how can I face all our clansmen?

08:02.879 --> 08:03.680
Clan Leader,

08:04.199 --> 08:05.319
I am willing to make amends.

08:06.000 --> 08:08.079
I'll give up all my family property

08:08.680 --> 08:09.639
to cover the deficit.

08:09.920 --> 08:13.399
And what about the 300 scholars
to be trained each year?

08:18.120 --> 08:19.160
I have decided.

08:19.480 --> 08:20.360
Cui Xiongkai,

08:20.360 --> 08:21.720
from this moment on,

08:21.720 --> 08:25.120
you are no longer the Cui clan's
representative in the capital.

08:26.000 --> 08:27.639
Hand over your
official seal immediately.

08:27.839 --> 08:29.160
Also, according to clan rules,

08:29.319 --> 08:30.639
your clan membership is revoked.

08:30.759 --> 08:33.680
You may never enter
the Cui clan ancestral hall again.

08:34.800 --> 08:35.560
Clan Leader!

08:36.839 --> 08:37.439
Father,

08:38.360 --> 08:39.959
I can't survive without the clan.

08:40.839 --> 08:42.439
I really know I was wrong!

08:43.759 --> 08:44.680
And you!

08:45.360 --> 08:47.079
Get out of the Wang residence right now.

08:47.300 --> 08:49.160
From now on,
regarding the Wang clan's assets,

08:49.319 --> 08:51.120
don't you dare touch a single fen!

08:55.360 --> 08:55.920
Father.

08:57.160 --> 08:57.720
Father.

08:59.199 --> 08:59.839
Father,

09:00.480 --> 09:01.959
I really know I was wrong.

09:02.680 --> 09:04.519
Please put in a good word
for me with Wei Hao.

09:04.519 --> 09:06.360
I'll never provoke him ever again.

09:07.160 --> 09:07.959
Father!

09:14.480 --> 09:15.279
Clan Leader,

09:15.480 --> 09:16.440
from now on,

09:16.480 --> 09:18.279
we will treat Wei Hao with respect.

09:18.279 --> 09:19.679
We will follow his every lead.

09:19.879 --> 09:21.639
Please don't kick me
out of the Wang clan.

09:26.559 --> 09:27.360
Clan Leader Wei,

09:28.039 --> 09:29.879
please plead with Wei Hao for me.

09:29.960 --> 09:31.519
I'll never provoke him again.

09:32.480 --> 09:34.080
I told you all a long time ago,

09:34.080 --> 09:35.279
but did you listen?

09:35.799 --> 09:36.600
Back then,

09:37.399 --> 09:41.039
you certainly didn't show
any respect to me.

09:42.520 --> 09:43.960
If you had known this day would come,

09:43.960 --> 09:46.519
why act so arrogantly
in the first place?

09:48.559 --> 09:49.320
Back then, it was...

09:49.320 --> 09:50.480
Enough talk.

09:50.600 --> 09:51.840
The clan rules must be obeyed.

09:52.159 --> 09:53.399
No one can change

09:53.720 --> 09:55.159
today's punishment.

09:55.399 --> 09:56.120
Someone,

09:56.279 --> 09:57.559
come drag these two away.

09:57.799 --> 09:59.639
Send them out of
the capital immediately.

10:00.960 --> 10:01.679
Clan Leader,

10:01.679 --> 10:02.759
don't drive me away.

10:03.240 --> 10:04.679
I can't leave the Wang clan.

10:04.679 --> 10:05.639
- Clan Leader.
- Father.

10:05.639 --> 10:06.679
- No.
- Father.

10:06.679 --> 10:07.399
- Clan Leader.
- Father.

10:07.399 --> 10:08.240
Clan Leader.

10:08.799 --> 10:09.799
Clan Leader!

10:30.399 --> 10:31.200
Hao,

10:31.679 --> 10:32.480
are you okay?

10:32.480 --> 10:33.240
I'm fine.

10:33.240 --> 10:34.039
Aunt,

10:34.080 --> 10:36.080
are you ready for
the banquet on the 22nd?

10:37.100 --> 10:39.320
The renovations on the new
Marquis Mansion are finishing up,

10:39.320 --> 10:40.400
so I have to go supervise.

10:40.410 --> 10:41.880
I still need to send out invitations.

10:44.159 --> 10:44.879
Right,

10:45.039 --> 10:46.919
we still have to hold
the banquet on the 22nd.

10:47.080 --> 10:48.039
Are we still doing it?

10:48.039 --> 10:48.879
Of course.

10:48.879 --> 10:50.850
I've already made
arrangements with my parents-in-law.

10:51.080 --> 10:52.000
Prepare well.

10:52.000 --> 10:53.159
We might need more tables.

10:53.159 --> 10:54.780
Those great clan
leaders will be coming too.

10:55.600 --> 10:56.399
What?

10:56.799 --> 10:58.200
The clan leaders are all coming?

10:59.000 --> 11:00.159
You've settled it?

11:00.600 --> 11:01.679
Of course.

11:01.680 --> 11:03.559
Is there anything
I can't handle once I step in?

11:03.559 --> 11:04.759
How did you settle it?

11:06.039 --> 11:07.690
You wouldn't
understand even if I told you.

11:08.799 --> 11:10.000
Well, you know,

11:10.000 --> 11:11.240
confidentiality is key.

11:11.559 --> 11:12.679
If word gets leaked out,

11:12.679 --> 11:15.799
those clan leaders might feel offended,
and that would be troublesome.

11:16.480 --> 11:18.000
Just focus on the preparations.

11:20.720 --> 11:21.360
By the way,

11:22.559 --> 11:24.919
don't tell anyone yet
about my parents-in-law coming.

11:25.210 --> 11:27.160
You have to keep
an eye on the kitchen yourself.

11:27.320 --> 11:29.519
Don't let any untrustworthy people in.

11:30.279 --> 11:31.080
Don't worry.

11:31.360 --> 11:33.080
I have plenty of people I can trust,

11:33.240 --> 11:36.360
and they are
completely loyal to our family.

11:37.039 --> 11:37.559
Good.

11:42.320 --> 11:43.120
Today,

11:43.480 --> 11:45.519
were any new petitions
for impeachment delivered?

11:45.919 --> 11:47.080
Your Majesty,

11:47.159 --> 11:48.559
there were no new ones.

11:52.120 --> 11:52.919
It seems

11:53.759 --> 11:56.519
the fool must have
settled the negotiations.

11:56.679 --> 11:57.320
Well?

11:57.360 --> 11:58.720
Is the brat here yet?

11:59.159 --> 12:00.759
The Marquis has entered the palace,

12:00.759 --> 12:01.519
but

12:02.200 --> 12:04.039
he went to see Her Highness.

12:04.200 --> 12:06.000
What's with this brat?

12:06.600 --> 12:07.799
Instead of reporting to me,

12:07.799 --> 12:08.919
he goes to see the girl?

12:09.519 --> 12:10.399
Cheng Chuchi.

12:11.039 --> 12:11.950
I am here, Your Majesty.

12:11.960 --> 12:13.919
Go tell the brat to come
to Ganlu Palace now.

12:14.279 --> 12:15.320
This brat...

12:15.480 --> 12:17.720
It's like I don't even
exist to him anymore.

12:18.000 --> 12:19.000
Yes, Your Majesty.

12:28.960 --> 12:29.759
Fool!

12:32.279 --> 12:32.960
Girl.

12:33.960 --> 12:34.840
How did it go?

12:34.840 --> 12:35.840
What did they say?

12:35.840 --> 12:37.360
Did they do anything to you?

12:37.360 --> 12:38.080
Girl,

12:38.080 --> 12:39.200
didn't you sleep well?

12:39.200 --> 12:40.679
Your eyes are all bloodshot.

12:41.679 --> 12:43.080
I just couldn't sleep.

12:43.279 --> 12:44.399
Tell me.

12:44.399 --> 12:45.919
How did the talks go?

12:46.039 --> 12:47.480
You're just worrying for nothing.

12:47.490 --> 12:49.770
I told you it was fine,
but you still didn't believe me.

12:50.159 --> 12:51.120
Don't worry.

12:51.200 --> 12:52.200
It's all settled.

12:53.159 --> 12:53.799
Right,

12:54.200 --> 12:55.639
remember to come on the 22nd.

12:55.690 --> 12:57.000
I'm hosting an engagement banquet.

12:57.080 --> 12:58.480
I can't pull it off without you.

12:59.080 --> 12:59.879
Really?

13:00.440 --> 13:01.639
It's really all settled?

13:01.812 --> 13:03.437
♪Colors and darkness♪

13:03.440 --> 13:04.679
You fool.

13:04.919 --> 13:06.720
I knew you could do it.

13:08.000 --> 13:09.000
I had to.

13:09.440 --> 13:09.919
Anyway,

13:10.039 --> 13:11.919
I have to go to the lords' houses later

13:11.919 --> 13:12.960
to deliver the invitations.

13:13.519 --> 13:16.519
The 22nd is coming up fast,
and I haven't even paid them a visit.

13:17.799 --> 13:18.679
You should go.

13:18.679 --> 13:20.000
Go quickly while you have time.

13:21.500 --> 13:25.575
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

13:26.512 --> 13:28.137
♪The world mistakes me♪

13:28.150 --> 13:30.412
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

13:30.500 --> 13:31.887
♪As the storm approaches♪

13:31.887 --> 13:34.575
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

13:35.639 --> 13:36.919
Well, Marquis Wei...

13:36.919 --> 13:37.639
Come on.

13:38.070 --> 13:38.720
Cheng Chuchi...

13:38.759 --> 13:39.890
His Majesty wants to see you.

13:40.840 --> 13:41.679
I'm busy.

13:41.810 --> 13:43.375
I have to go deliver invitations later.

13:43.570 --> 13:45.080
Does my father-in-law have a problem?

13:45.440 --> 13:46.759
That, I wouldn't know.

13:46.960 --> 13:48.200
You'd better just go.

13:50.399 --> 13:50.960
Go...

13:51.080 --> 13:52.039
Go ahead.

13:52.240 --> 13:54.879
Since Father is looking for you,
it must be something important.

13:54.879 --> 13:57.590
My father-in-law is really something,
always making trouble for people.

13:57.612 --> 14:00.762
♪We are free and happy♪

14:14.250 --> 14:17.080
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

14:17.700 --> 14:21.100
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

14:21.870 --> 14:24.820
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

14:25.160 --> 14:27.860
♪Sigh and walk away♪

14:29.460 --> 14:32.930
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

14:32.930 --> 14:35.160
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

14:35.160 --> 14:37.270
♪Colors and darkness♪

14:37.270 --> 14:39.290
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

14:39.290 --> 14:43.650
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

14:45.090 --> 14:48.820
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

14:49.090 --> 14:52.690
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

14:52.850 --> 14:54.930
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

14:54.930 --> 14:59.720
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

14:59.940 --> 15:01.560
♪The world mistakes me♪

15:01.560 --> 15:03.900
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

15:03.970 --> 15:05.160
♪As the storm approaches♪

15:05.160 --> 15:07.560
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

15:07.770 --> 15:09.490
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

15:09.490 --> 15:11.470
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

15:11.640 --> 15:13.390
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

15:13.390 --> 15:15.490
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

15:15.490 --> 15:16.960
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

15:16.960 --> 15:19.190
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

15:19.410 --> 15:20.610
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

15:20.610 --> 15:23.130
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

15:23.260 --> 15:24.970
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

15:24.970 --> 15:26.250
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

15:26.400 --> 15:27.820
♪My wish has finally come true♪

15:27.820 --> 15:28.860
♪To stay by your side♪

15:28.860 --> 15:30.780
♪In this fleeting world♪

15:30.950 --> 15:34.200
♪We are free and happy♪

15:38.200 --> 15:39.980
♪From a nobody♪

15:39.980 --> 15:41.880
♪To someone now famous♪

15:41.990 --> 15:43.420
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

15:43.420 --> 15:45.930
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

15:46.030 --> 15:47.610
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

15:47.610 --> 15:49.680
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

15:49.890 --> 15:51.570
♪In this vast world♪

15:51.570 --> 15:53.570
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

15:53.720 --> 15:55.930
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

15:55.930 --> 15:57.520
♪Everything ends eventually♪

15:57.610 --> 15:59.110
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

15:59.110 --> 16:01.510
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

16:01.510 --> 16:03.220
♪No matter how time flies♪

16:03.220 --> 16:04.380
♪Even if the falling snow♪

16:04.380 --> 16:06.010
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

16:06.010 --> 16:07.050
♪All I want now♪

16:07.050 --> 16:09.150
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

16:09.150 --> 16:12.410
♪Year after year♪
